==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A few meatshields and an attacker such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is all you need to win.

